[Chaebe: You gonna call too, Eunchae?]
[Eunchae: Wait, me?]

226
00:09:43,670 --> 00:09:44,700
Why, why, why?

227
00:09:44,660 --> 00:09:47,780
[Eunchae: Why do you think that?]
[Chaebe: Go ahead, go.]

228
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:49,100
Go ahead.

229
00:09:53,390 --> 00:09:57,660
[Jinwoo is calling while heading to the room]

230
00:09:58,500 --> 00:10:02,460
[Jinwoo: An overnight stay feels a bit much.]

231
00:10:02,730 --> 00:10:06,060
[Jinwoo: I don't want Seungho]

232
00:10:06,060 --> 00:10:07,900
[Jinwoo: to spend an overnight date
with someone else.]

233
00:10:07,900 --> 00:10:10,020
[Jinwoo: So I just dialed him first.]

234
00:10:16,340 --> 00:10:21,150
[Seungho isn't picking up]

235
00:10:22,940 --> 00:10:27,020
[Jinwoo: He's not picking up. It's just ringing.]

236
00:10:33,690 --> 00:10:36,630
[Jinwoo: Ah. Is he turning me down?]

237
00:10:45,060 --> 00:10:48,910
[Jinwoo: I was like, is he turning me down?]

238
00:10:51,050 --> 00:10:53,980
[Heejin: Done?]
[Jinwoo: He's not picking up?]

239
00:10:54,580 --> 00:10:55,980
[Jinwoo: Should I try again?]

240
00:10:55,980 --> 00:10:57,450
[Heejin: Can you call from here?]

241
00:10:58,020 --> 00:10:59,140
[Heejin: Just call right here.]

242
00:10:59,140 --> 00:10:59,540
[Okay!]
[Heejin: Just call right here.]

243
00:10:59,540 --> 00:11:00,420
[Okay!]
[Eunchae: It's already dialing.]

244
00:11:00,420 --> 00:11:01,460
[Eunchae: It's already dialing.]

245
00:11:04,130 --> 00:11:06,260
[Jinwoo: If he doesn't answer, that's a no, right?]

246
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:18,540
[Eunchae: Is he... hesitating?]

247
00:11:18,540 --> 00:11:19,870
[Eunchae: The ringtone should sound, right?]

248
00:11:26,550 --> 00:11:27,740
[Seungho: Hello?]

249
00:11:27,740 --> 00:11:29,820
[Jinwoo: Hey.]

250
00:11:30,780 --> 00:11:34,020
[Heejin: Where are you going? Put it on speaker.]
[Jinwoo: What? What are you doing?]

251
00:11:34,540 --> 00:11:36,780
[Seungho: Wait, why are you calling all of a sudden?]

252
00:11:36,780 --> 00:11:40,060
[Jinwoo: Got a mission.]
[Seungho: Ah, really?]

253
00:11:40,060 --> 00:11:43,020
[Seungho: I didn't check my phone.]

254
00:11:43,020 --> 00:11:44,700
[Seungho: I just saw an incoming call.]

255
00:11:44,700 --> 00:11:46,100
[Jinwoo: Ah, really?]

256
00:11:46,100 --> 00:11:48,940
[Seungho: I was thinking, "Is that Jinwoo?"]

257
00:11:48,940 --> 00:11:50,110
[Seungho: "Who is it?"]

258
00:11:50,110 --> 00:11:51,340
[Hahaha]
[Seungho: "Who is it?"]

259
00:11:54,550 --> 00:11:56,950
[Yongkyu: I heard the first thing he said]

260
00:11:56,950 --> 00:11:58,550
[Yongkyu: when he answered the phone.]

261
00:11:58,550 --> 00:12:03,090
[Yongkyu: It might be one of the guests calling.]

262
00:12:03,890 --> 00:12:06,020
[Jinwoo: Isn't it an overnight date?]

263
00:12:06,020 --> 00:12:08,430
[Seungho: Yeah, just found out.]

264
00:12:08,430 --> 00:12:09,760
[Jinwoo: Ah, yeah?]

265
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:12,160
[Jinwoo: Then come back to BI-LIVE.]

266
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:15,630
[Seungho: Huh? What do you mean?]
[Jinwoo: It's for the mission.]

267
00:12:16,170 --> 00:12:18,040
[Seungho: Ah, what's going on right now...]

268
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:22,570
[Jinwoo: The mission is to call]

269
00:12:22,570 --> 00:12:26,040
[Jinwoo: someone you want back at BI-LIVE tonight.]

270
00:12:26,580 --> 00:12:29,250
[Jinwoo: So I call you.]

271
00:12:29,250 --> 00:12:30,850
[Seungho: What if I don't come back?]

272
00:12:31,650 --> 00:12:35,650
[Jinwoo: Then stay another day there.]

273
00:12:35,650 --> 00:12:38,590
[Jinwoo: It's your call.]

274
00:12:39,390 --> 00:12:40,720
[Seungho: Ah, seriously...]

275
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:43,130
[Seungho: What are you... doing?]

276
00:12:43,130 --> 00:12:45,800
[Seungho: It's weird if I go back,
and weird if I don't.]

277
00:12:45,800 --> 00:12:48,730
[Seungho: I don't know. I can't deal with this.]

278
00:12:48,730 --> 00:12:51,940
[Jinwoo: If you don't come back,
I'll take it as a no.]

279
00:12:51,940 --> 00:12:53,000
[Jinwoo: Right?]

280
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:57,010
[Seungho: Ah... I don't know.]

281
00:12:57,010 --> 00:12:58,080
[Jinwoo: You don't know?]

282
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:03,950
[Jinwoo: If you don't come back,
how do you think I'll feel?]

283
00:13:03,950 --> 00:13:06,620
[Seungho: At least there are other people there.]

284
00:13:10,090 --> 00:13:12,220
[Seungho: Who's at BI-LIVE right now?]

285
00:13:12,220 --> 00:13:14,360
[Seungho: Is everyone back?]

286
00:13:13,140 --> 00:13:14,360
Is everyone at the house?

287
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:15,690
[Jinwoo: Not telling you.]

288
00:13:15,690 --> 00:13:18,630
[Jinwoo: If you don't come back,
I might be all alone.]

289
00:13:18,630 --> 00:13:20,500
[Jinwoo: No comments about that, either.]

290
00:13:21,500 --> 00:13:22,760
What are you doing?

291
00:13:21,700 --> 00:13:23,020
[Stomping feet]

292
00:13:23,260 --> 00:13:25,570
[Seungho: You shouldn't have called.]

293
00:13:25,940 --> 00:13:28,660
[Seungho: You shouldn't have called.]

294
00:13:28,660 --> 00:13:29,980
[Jinwoo: Oh?]

295
00:13:29,980 --> 00:13:32,340
[Seungho: Look, it's not like I can't decide.]

296
00:13:32,660 --> 00:13:35,180
[Seungho: Of course I wanna go back, but...]

297
00:13:35,180 --> 00:13:37,580
[Seungho: it's so hard to do that in this situation.]

298
00:13:37,940 --> 00:13:40,520
[Seungho: I wish I didn't know anything.]

299
00:13:40,520 --> 00:13:43,450
[Seungho: What do I do...]

300
00:13:43,450 --> 00:13:46,120
[Jinwoo: You're worrying about Yongkyu right now.]

301
00:13:46,920 --> 00:13:48,790
[Seungho: Yes.]

302
00:13:50,130 --> 00:13:53,060
[Jinwoo: What about me...
why aren't you thinking about me?]

303
00:13:53,060 --> 00:13:55,470
[Jinwoo: I might be sitting home alone tonight.]

304
00:13:55,470 --> 00:13:57,870
[Seungho: You're not alone, though.]

305
00:13:57,870 --> 00:14:00,940
[Jinwoo: But you never know.]

306
00:14:00,940 --> 00:14:03,470
[Seungho: But you didn't
consider my side either, did you?]

307
00:14:03,470 --> 00:14:09,880
[Seungho: You have no idea
what I'm dealing with right now.]

308
00:14:09,880 --> 00:14:12,550
[Jinwoo: I don't know your situation,]

309
00:14:12,550 --> 00:14:14,690
[Jinwoo: I just saw the mission and called.]

310
00:14:14,690 --> 00:14:16,820
[Jinwoo: I didn't mean to put you on the spot.]

311
00:14:17,580 --> 00:14:18,620
[Sigh...]

312
00:14:18,620 --> 00:14:21,360
[Seungho: Hold on...]

313
00:14:21,070 --> 00:14:21,500
Hold on a sec.

314
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:24,300
[Seungho: Let me check SBM Talk first.]

315
00:14:24,830 --> 00:14:29,100
[Seungho: Are you staying out tonight?]
[Seungho texting Hyeyeon]

316
00:14:29,900 --> 00:14:32,300
[Seungho: Do I have to decide right now?]

317
00:14:32,300 --> 00:14:33,900
[Jinwoo: I don't know, either.]

318
00:14:34,170 --> 00:14:36,040
[Seungho: Okay, got it.]

319
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:37,370
[Jinwoo: Got it...]

320
00:14:37,910 --> 00:14:41,540
[The call ends awkwardly]

321
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:43,870
That's what I think.

322
00:14:43,870 --> 00:14:45,160
So,

323
00:14:45,160 --> 00:14:47,200
-you were also... -Yeah.

324
00:14:48,850 --> 00:14:49,780
[Sujin: Hey, you got a text?]

325
00:14:50,340 --> 00:14:51,450
I don't know, just now...

326
00:14:50,980 --> 00:14:53,220
[Panicked]

327
00:14:57,920 --> 00:14:59,390
So you were...

328
00:14:59,140 --> 00:15:01,180
[Fidgeting]

329
00:15:01,300 --> 00:15:03,340
[Staring]

330
00:15:03,380 --> 00:15:05,670
[Sujin: Take a look.]

331
00:15:06,290 --> 00:15:08,360
Wait, let me check first.

332
00:15:08,500 --> 00:15:11,940
[Wanna continue the date?
If you end it, return to BI-LIVE immediately.
GO (Continue) BACK (Return)]

333
00:15:12,220 --> 00:15:14,480
[Hyeyeon: The crew... Let me send a text.]

334
00:15:16,140 --> 00:15:18,220
[Hyeyeon: I heard the notification and checked.]

335
00:15:18,220 --> 00:15:21,690
[Hyeyeon: It said we could end the date and go back.]

336
00:15:22,490 --> 00:15:24,890
[Hyeyeon: That's so harsh.]

337
00:15:25,060 --> 00:15:28,360
[Hyeyeon: I felt a lot of pressure.]

338
00:15:30,490 --> 00:15:32,360
[Sujin: Pour some soda here?]

339
00:15:32,630 --> 00:15:37,430
[Hyeyeon can't hear a thing in the chaos]

340
00:15:37,430 --> 00:15:41,900
[Seungho: I think there was a mission
where you could call someone
and ask them to come back
to BI-LIVE instead of staying overnight.
So I'm torn between going back
and staying here with Yongkyu.]

341
00:15:41,900 --> 00:15:45,820
[Hyeyeon: You just got the text too, right?
What did you choose? I'm curious what you think.]

342
00:15:45,980 --> 00:15:48,540
[Humming]

343
00:15:49,100 --> 00:15:50,250
[Sujin: Hey, you know what?]

344
00:15:49,980 --> 00:15:50,300
What?

345
00:15:50,250 --> 00:15:53,450
[Sujin: You start humming
whenever you're trying to hide something.]

346
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:55,590
[Sujin: You didn't know that, did you?]

347
00:15:55,590 --> 00:15:56,920
[Hyeyeon: Says who?]

348
00:15:56,920 --> 00:15:58,790
[Sujin: Says me.]
[Hyeyeon: No, I just]

349
00:15:58,790 --> 00:16:01,020
[Hyeyeon: suddenly felt like singing.]

350
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:09,300
[Seungho: I think there was a mission
where you could call someone
and ask them to come back
to BI-LIVE instead of staying overnight.
So I'm torn between going back
and staying here with Yongkyu.]
[Hyeyeon: You just got the text too, right?
What did you choose? I'm curious what you think.]

351
00:16:01,690 --> 00:16:03,570
-You totally have that habit. -Really?

352
00:16:03,570 --> 00:16:05,030
Then I won't do it anymore.

353
00:16:05,730 --> 00:16:08,460
-La, la, la, la, la. -That's the exact same thing!

354
00:16:10,530 --> 00:16:14,810
[Hyeyeon: Seungho and I had
the same number of texts left.]

355
00:16:14,810 --> 00:16:17,580
[Hyeyeon: The number of SBM Talks Seungho
has left keeps going down.]

356
00:16:17,580 --> 00:16:19,080
[Hyeyeon:What would he choose?]

357
00:16:20,220 --> 00:16:23,880
[Hyeyeon: My #2 choice is right in front of me,
while #1 is probably at the house.]

358
00:16:23,880 --> 00:16:27,620
[Hyeyeon: If my choice makes my #1 choice]

359
00:16:27,620 --> 00:16:30,020
[Hyeyeon: turn away from me like this...]

360
00:16:30,550 --> 00:16:34,290
[Hyeyeon: It was such a tough call.]

361
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:39,900
[What will Hyeyeon choose?]

362
00:16:40,430 --> 00:16:42,830
[Hyeyeon: I'll make my choice first.]

363
00:16:45,500 --> 00:16:47,370
[Sujin: Go ahead.]

364
00:16:48,180 --> 00:16:54,040
[Hyeyeon: Kinda curious. 0 left?]
[Hyeyeon: I think I'll stay tonight,
though not sure what you picked!
I'll change your Band-Aid tomorrow.
Take medicine if your stomach hurts!
Feel free to use my stuff at the house.
If you decide to stay, let me know when you're back!
Good night, just in case!]

365
00:16:54,710 --> 00:17:01,520
[Wanna continue the date? If you end it,
return to BI-LIVE immediately.
GO (Continue) BACK (Return)]

366
00:17:02,260 --> 00:17:04,819
[Hyeyeon: I've made my choice.]

367
00:17:04,819 --> 00:17:05,790
[Sujin: What did you pick?]

368
00:17:05,790 --> 00:17:06,589
[Sujin: "Just treat it like a show?"]

369
00:17:06,589 --> 00:17:08,730
[Not like that.]

370
00:17:08,579 --> 00:17:09,040
"Just treat it like a show?"

371
00:17:09,030 --> 00:17:11,400
[Hyeyeon: Bye. Just kidding!]

372
00:17:12,300 --> 00:17:14,329
[Hyeyeon: Let's keep eating.]

373
00:17:14,599 --> 00:17:15,670
[Sujin: Whoa, you picked me!]

374
00:17:14,660 --> 00:17:16,089
-You picked me! -Not necessarily.

375
00:17:15,670 --> 00:17:18,339
[Sujin: You were thinking about ditching me!]

376
00:17:16,089 --> 00:17:18,530
-You were thinking about ditching me! -Don't know.

377
00:17:18,339 --> 00:17:19,140
[Hyeyeon: You never know.]

378
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:20,470
[Sujin: "Just treat it like a show"?]

379
00:17:20,470 --> 00:17:22,339
[Hyeyeon: Why do you keep saying that?]

380
00:17:22,869 --> 00:17:26,079
[Hyeyeon: Seungho used up all his SBM Talks.]

381
00:17:26,079 --> 00:17:29,550
[Hyeyeon: He definitely went back.]

382
00:17:31,150 --> 00:17:33,550
[Hyeyeon: He picked Jinwoo.]

383
00:17:34,700 --> 00:17:38,890
[Hyeyeon: Did I make the right call picking Sujin?]

384
00:17:40,490 --> 00:17:42,890
[Hyeyeon: Even though I decided to stay overnight,]

385
00:17:42,890 --> 00:17:47,160
[Hyeyeon: thinking about all this
gave me mixed feelings.]

386
00:17:50,100 --> 00:17:52,240
[Sujin: Now that the overnight stay is set,]

387
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:56,770
[Sujin: of course, Seungho is still her top choice,]

388
00:17:57,570 --> 00:18:02,380
[Sujin: but maybe she wanted]

389
00:18:02,380 --> 00:18:03,980
[Sujin: to focus more on me today?]

390
00:18:05,850 --> 00:18:08,520
[Sujin: That's pretty sweet, honestly.]

391
00:18:10,120 --> 00:18:13,590
[The two spending the night together]

392
00:18:21,600 --> 00:18:24,270
[Yongkyu: What... what call?]

393
00:18:24,270 --> 00:18:28,010
[Seungho: Ah... hold on,
I really need a second to think.]

394
00:18:29,870 --> 00:18:31,740
[Yongkyu: Yeah, take your time.]

395
00:18:34,950 --> 00:18:36,810
[Seungho: I had absolutely no clue what to do.]

396
00:18:36,810 --> 00:18:40,280
[Seungho: I’m kind of losing it.]

397
00:18:44,140 --> 00:18:45,620
[Yongkyu: Is it that serious...]

398
00:18:45,620 --> 00:18:46,420
[Seungho: Yeah.]

399
00:18:48,060 --> 00:18:50,690
[Only Seungho gets a text message]

400
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:54,430
[Wanna continue the date? If you end it,
return to BI-LIVE immediately.
GO (Continue) BACK (Return)]

401
00:18:54,700 --> 00:18:57,100
[Seungho: One of them is gonna]

402
00:18:57,100 --> 00:18:59,500
[Seungho: get hurt because of me.]

403
00:18:59,500 --> 00:19:01,640
[Seungho: I'm so torn.]

404
00:19:03,770 --> 00:19:08,310
[What will Seungho choose?]

405
00:19:12,580 --> 00:19:13,650
[Chaebe: Thoughts afterward.]

406
00:19:15,380 --> 00:19:17,260
[Heejin: How was it? Spill!]

407
00:19:17,650 --> 00:19:18,990
[Heejin: What did you guys talk about?]

408
00:19:18,990 --> 00:19:21,660
[Jinwoo: He had no idea about the mission.]

409
00:19:21,660 --> 00:19:23,260
[Jinwoo: So I had to fill him in.]

410
00:19:23,260 --> 00:19:26,200
[Heejin: Is he staying there?]

411
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:27,800
[Jinwoo: Nah, still up in the air.]

412
00:19:28,070 --> 00:19:31,000
[Eunchae: Maybe you just don't...]
[Jinwoo: I told him to take some time
and think about it.]

413
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:34,200
[Chaebe: Then he probably would tell Yongkyu.]

414
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:35,810
[Jinwoo: Yeah, he'd probably mention it
after hanging up.]

415
00:19:35,810 --> 00:19:37,670
[Jinwoo: But then I suddenly felt]

416
00:19:37,670 --> 00:19:40,080
[Jinwoo: a little upset.]

417
00:19:40,080 --> 00:19:41,680
[Jinwoo: You know what he said?]

418
00:19:40,580 --> 00:19:41,540
What did he say?

419
00:19:43,010 --> 00:19:44,350
[Jinwoo: "Ugh, why'd you call all of a sudden?"]

420
00:19:44,580 --> 00:19:45,660
[Whoa]

421
00:19:46,300 --> 00:19:49,150
[Eunchae: Right when he picked up?]
[Jinwoo: Nah, midway through the call.]

422
00:19:49,150 --> 00:19:50,490
[Jinwoo: "Why'd you call all of a sudden?"]

423
00:19:50,490 --> 00:19:55,290
[Jinwoo: He said I put him on the spot,]

424
00:19:55,830 --> 00:19:58,230
[Jinwoo: so I got kind of upset.]

425
00:19:58,230 --> 00:20:01,170
[Jinwoo: But it's not like I don't get
where he's coming from.]

426
00:20:01,170 --> 00:20:03,030
[Jinwoo: I get it.]

427
00:20:03,030 --> 00:20:04,370
[Jinwoo: If I put myself in his shoes...]

428
00:20:05,170 --> 00:20:07,300
[Heejin: I get it...]

429
00:20:07,570 --> 00:20:09,180
[Heejin: but talking to you like that...]

430
00:20:09,180 --> 00:20:10,240
[Yeah.]
[Heejin: but talking to you like that...]

431
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:12,110
[Jinwoo: We just hung up like that,]

432
00:20:12,110 --> 00:20:14,510
[Jinwoo: I don't know if he's coming back.]

433
00:20:14,510 --> 00:20:16,910
[Jinwoo: And even if he does,
things might be super awkward.]

434
00:20:16,910 --> 00:20:19,050
[Jinwoo: I didn't expect that reaction at all.]

435
00:20:19,050 --> 00:20:20,120
[Jinwoo: If that's how he feels,]

436
00:20:20,380 --> 00:20:24,390
[Jinwoo: he might as well stay there.
We can talk tomorrow anyway.]

437
00:20:24,660 --> 00:20:27,940
[Heejin: "If you were in my shoes
and got that mission,]

438
00:20:27,940 --> 00:20:31,330
[Heejin: wouldn't you have made the call too?"
If you ask him that,]

439
00:20:31,330 --> 00:20:33,460
[Heejin: I wonder what Seungho would say.]

440
00:20:33,460 --> 00:20:34,800
[Eunchae: Just ask him tomorrow.]

441
00:20:34,800 --> 00:20:36,930
[Heejin: Right, ask him tomorrow.]

442
00:20:37,140 --> 00:20:38,300
[Fidgeting]

443
00:20:38,380 --> 00:20:40,670
[Jinwoo: Feels like...]

444
00:20:40,670 --> 00:20:44,940
[Jinwoo: I've got so much built up inside now.]

445
00:20:44,940 --> 00:20:46,740
[Jinwoo: And little by little... how do I put this?]

446
00:20:46,740 --> 00:20:50,010
[Jinwoo: I used to be so sure.]

447
00:20:50,340 --> 00:20:53,980
[Jinwoo: I already knew who I'd pick in the end.]

448
00:20:53,980 --> 00:20:55,940
[Jinwoo: "I'm choosing Kim Seungho,"]

449
00:20:55,940 --> 00:20:57,180
[Jinwoo: But now, somehow,]

450
00:20:57,180 --> 00:21:00,960
[Jinwoo: my feelings have become a little...]

451
00:21:01,900 --> 00:21:05,500
[Jinwoo: unclear. I'm not sure if should pick him.]

452
00:21:06,460 --> 00:21:08,170
[Eunchae: You still got plenty of time.]

453
00:21:09,500 --> 00:21:14,040
[Heejin: That's just how you feel right now.]

454
00:21:15,370 --> 00:21:17,100
[Jinwoo: Do me a favor, guys.]
[Heejin: What is it?]

455
00:21:17,100 --> 00:21:18,420
[Jinwoo: If Seungho doesn't show up,]

456
00:21:18,420 --> 00:21:20,140
[Jinwoo: drink with me till sunrise.]

457
00:21:20,620 --> 00:21:22,140
[Jinwoo: Basically, I don't want
anyone to leave my side.]

458
00:21:22,140 --> 00:21:23,110
[Heejin: Got it.]

459
00:21:30,180 --> 00:21:34,320
[Heejin: That, I can promise you.]

460
00:21:30,210 --> 00:21:31,940
-That, I can promise you. -Alright, cool.

461
00:21:31,940 --> 00:21:32,490
Yeah.

462
00:21:34,320 --> 00:21:35,930
[Jinwoo: I'll try to get some sleep early.]

463
00:21:36,260 --> 00:21:40,800
[Will Seungho return to BI-LIVE like Jinwoo wants?]

464
00:21:41,260 --> 00:21:43,400
[Heejin: You were hungry, right? Let's eat.]

465
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:44,740
[Chaebe: Let's eat.]

466
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:49,270
[Having a simple dinner]

467
00:21:47,340 --> 00:21:48,090
Pretty good.

468
00:21:50,070 --> 00:21:52,210
[Jinwoo: Tastes amazing.]

469
00:21:52,210 --> 00:21:53,280
[Chaebe: Glad you like it.]

470
00:21:59,890 --> 00:22:00,770
Hey guys.

471
00:22:01,580 --> 00:22:02,610
Hey.

472
00:22:02,890 --> 00:22:05,020
[Heejin: Oh, what?]

473
00:22:05,560 --> 00:22:06,890
[Seungho: Hey, everyone.]

474
00:22:06,720 --> 00:22:07,630
Wait, what?

475
00:22:07,820 --> 00:22:10,090
[Seungho chose to come back to BI-LIVE]

476
00:22:09,110 --> 00:22:10,360
I bought some booze.

477
00:22:10,360 --> 00:22:11,300
For real?

478
00:22:11,960 --> 00:22:17,030
[Jinwoo: He came back.]

479
00:22:17,030 --> 00:22:20,770
[Jinwoo: Things were pretty tense
when we were on the phone.]

480
00:22:20,770 --> 00:22:24,240
[Jinwoo: I heard some hurtful stuff,]

481
00:22:24,510 --> 00:22:25,840
[Jinwoo: but I felt a bit relieved seeing him.]

482
00:22:26,070 --> 00:22:27,360
-Did you eat? -Got your favorite.

483
00:22:26,910 --> 00:22:31,980
[Why did Seungho come back to BI-LIVE?]

484
00:22:27,360 --> 00:22:28,090
Yeah.

485
00:22:28,090 --> 00:22:29,650
-Wanna grab a bite? -Nah, you guys eat.

486
00:22:29,650 --> 00:22:31,810
I'm stuffed already.

487
00:22:31,810 --> 00:22:32,760
Really?

488
00:22:33,900 --> 00:22:36,700
[Inside the car back to BI-LIVE]

489
00:22:37,100 --> 00:22:38,620
[Yongkyu: Quick question.]

490
00:22:38,620 --> 00:22:39,720
[Seungho: What's up?]

491
00:22:39,990 --> 00:22:43,730
[Yongkyu: If we brought our bags,]

492
00:22:43,730 --> 00:22:45,060
[Yongkyu: would you have stayed?]

493
00:22:47,730 --> 00:22:51,200
[Seungho: Fifty-fifty, maybe.]

494
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:52,800
[Seungho: There was another reason.]

495
00:22:53,340 --> 00:22:54,670
[Yongkyu: Another reason?]

496
00:22:54,020 --> 00:22:54,410
Yeah.

497
00:22:54,670 --> 00:22:56,540
[Seungho: Besides that...]

498
00:22:57,340 --> 00:23:00,280
[Yongkyu: Fifty-fifty isn't that high though?]

499
00:23:00,280 --> 00:23:01,610
[Seungho: Because of that reason.]

500
00:23:01,610 --> 00:23:03,750
[Seungho: Otherwise, I totally would've stayed.]

501
00:23:05,080 --> 00:23:08,550
[Seungho: Without that reason,
I would've stayed even without my bags.]

502
00:23:10,580 --> 00:23:13,090
[Yongkyu: I'm done overthinking it.]

503
00:23:15,660 --> 00:23:19,060
[Seungho: The one I like more]

504
00:23:19,060 --> 00:23:20,830
[Seungho: is Jinwoo.]

505
00:23:20,830 --> 00:23:24,030
[Seungho: So I should go with who I actually like.]

506
00:23:24,030 --> 00:23:25,640
[Seungho: That's why I came back.]

507
00:23:26,700 --> 00:23:28,570
[Heejin: Sit here.]

508
00:23:29,110 --> 00:23:31,300
[Jinwoo: Where's Yongkyu?]
[Chaebe: You came back alone?]

509
00:23:31,900 --> 00:23:33,910
[Seungho: He didn't come back.]

510
00:23:34,940 --> 00:23:36,540
[Shocked]

511
00:23:40,700 --> 00:23:43,700
[Seungho: Just kidding, he came back with me.]

512
00:23:42,550 --> 00:23:44,010
Right? Scared me for a sec.

513
00:23:44,500 --> 00:23:46,780
[Relieved]

514
00:23:47,220 --> 00:23:50,190
[Seungho: He's outside having a smoke.]

515
00:23:52,600 --> 00:23:54,200
[Yongkyu: I was overthinking it,]

516
00:23:54,200 --> 00:23:56,870
[Yongkyu: wondering what made him
choose to come back.]

517
00:23:56,870 --> 00:23:59,000
[Yongkyu: He told me it was]

518
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:00,600
[Yongkyu: because he didn't bring his bags,]

519
00:24:00,600 --> 00:24:03,270
[Yongkyu: but there was clearly more to it.]

520
00:24:03,270 --> 00:24:05,940
[Yongkyu: I just kept thinking about it.]

521
00:24:06,300 --> 00:24:08,140
[Seungho: What were you guys doing?]

522
00:24:07,850 --> 00:24:08,140
Us?

523
00:24:08,140 --> 00:24:11,010
[Heejin: We cooked dinner, then ate.]

524
00:24:11,010 --> 00:24:14,480
[Heejin: I boiled some eggs, turned out so good.]

525
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:16,090
[Seungho: Wish I could eat, but I'm stuffed.]

526
00:24:16,350 --> 00:24:17,150
[Jinwoo: What did you guys have?]

527
00:24:17,150 --> 00:24:20,620
[Seungho: Meat, ramen, army stew.]

528
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:26,500
[Yongkyu walks in later]

529
00:24:27,300 --> 00:24:28,370
[Heejin: Oh, you're back?]

530
00:24:28,370 --> 00:24:29,700
[Yongkyu: Oh. What are you eating?]

531
00:24:30,300 --> 00:24:32,300
[Eyes fixed on him]

532
00:24:30,690 --> 00:24:31,690
Hey, you're back.

533
00:24:32,500 --> 00:24:36,110
[Chaebe: I was worried about Yongkyu.]

534
00:24:36,110 --> 00:24:40,640
[Chaebe: It could've been a perfect date.
He must be bummed out.]

535
00:24:40,640 --> 00:24:43,310
[Chaebe: But I was glad he got back.]

536
00:24:43,980 --> 00:24:47,320
[Heejin: You guys had tons of good food, right?]

537
00:24:51,050 --> 00:24:52,660
[Seungho: I bought this, too.]

538
00:24:53,460 --> 00:24:54,790
[Jinwoo: Oh, what's this? Matching set?]

539
00:24:55,860 --> 00:24:57,990
[Yongkyu: Just grabbed whatever.]

540
00:24:57,990 --> 00:25:00,660
[Jinwoo: Ah, just on a whim?]

541
00:25:00,660 --> 00:25:03,070
[Yongkyu: Picked up some stuff for myself.]
[Jinwoo: Looks good, looks good.]

542
00:25:03,070 --> 00:25:04,940
[Yongkyu: Seungho bought drinks for everyone.]

543
00:25:04,940 --> 00:25:07,070
[Heejin: Really?]

544
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:07,330
Nice.

545
00:25:07,870 --> 00:25:11,070
[Jinwoo: Let's have some drinks after dinner.]
[Seungho: In a bit.]

546
00:25:11,070 --> 00:25:12,940
[Jinwoo: Set a time then?
What time should we gather?]

547
00:25:12,940 --> 00:25:14,010
[Yongkyu: A little drinking session?]

548
00:25:14,540 --> 00:25:18,820
[Jinwoo: You guys had a long ride,
so whenever you're ready.]

549
00:25:20,150 --> 00:25:23,090
[Seungho: 11:00?]

550
00:25:23,940 --> 00:25:24,900
11:00.

551
00:25:25,340 --> 00:25:28,960
[Jinwoo: Alright, get cleaned up.
See you at 11:00.]

552
00:25:31,180 --> 00:25:33,760
[After dinner, only Seungho & Jinwoo are left]

553
00:25:34,030 --> 00:25:36,430
[Jinwoo: How'd you explain coming back?]

554
00:25:36,430 --> 00:25:38,840
[Seungho: I lied.]
[Jinwoo: What'd you say?]

555
00:25:39,640 --> 00:25:43,110
[Seungho: Said I had no skincare stuff,]
[Jinwoo: Uh-huh,]

556
00:25:43,110 --> 00:25:45,510
[Seungho: and no extra clothes, so...]

557
00:25:47,110 --> 00:25:48,540
[Seungho: I had to come back.]

558
00:25:48,540 --> 00:25:50,620
[Nod]
[Seungho: I had to come back.]

559
00:25:52,180 --> 00:25:55,920
[Jinwoo: Eunchae and Chaebe might tell him.]

560
00:25:55,920 --> 00:25:57,250
[Seungho: There was no other way.]

561
00:25:57,250 --> 00:25:59,660
[Seungho: I hinted at it anyway...]

562
00:25:59,660 --> 00:26:01,790
[Seungho: I said there were other reasons.]

563
00:26:01,790 --> 00:26:03,130
[Seungho: He asked, "if you had skincare,]

564
00:26:03,130 --> 00:26:04,860
[Seungho: would you]

565
00:26:04,860 --> 00:26:08,200
[Seungho: stay tonight?"]

566
00:26:08,200 --> 00:26:10,330
[Seungho: So I told him there were other reasons.]

567
00:26:10,330 --> 00:26:13,270
[Seungho: I didn't tell him details, though.]

568
00:26:13,270 --> 00:26:16,740
[Seungho: I said there were other reasons.]

569
00:26:17,010 --> 00:26:21,660
[Jinwoo: I got the mission text
right in front of everyone.]

570
00:26:21,660 --> 00:26:26,180
[Jinwoo: Everyone knows.]
[Seungho: Who... who called?]

571
00:26:26,180 --> 00:26:28,750
[Seungho: What about Hyeyeon's side?]
[Jinwoo: What?]

572
00:26:28,750 --> 00:26:31,960
[Seungho: Hyeyeon and Sujin.]
[Jinwoo: Nobody called them.]

573
00:26:31,960 --> 00:26:34,620
[Jinwoo: So I...]
[Seungho: No way? Someone must have.]

574
00:26:34,620 --> 00:26:37,420
[Jinwoo: Did they?]

575
00:26:37,420 --> 00:26:39,960
[Jinwoo: Didn't see anyone do it.]
[Seungho: Really?]

576
00:26:41,260 --> 00:26:43,340
[Seungho: Alright.]

577
00:26:43,340 --> 00:26:46,640
[Seungho: Whatever then.]
[Jinwoo: How'd you know though?]

578
00:26:47,170 --> 00:26:48,510
[Seungho: Don't know the details,]

579
00:26:48,510 --> 00:26:50,370
[Seungho: I just assumed someone called.]

580
00:26:50,370 --> 00:26:53,580
[Seungho: When I was chatting with her...]
[Jinwoo: Ah, while chatting with her.]

581
00:26:53,580 --> 00:26:55,450
[Heejin: Back again.]
[Seungho: What's up? Forget something?]

582
00:26:55,450 --> 00:26:56,780
[Heejin: Nah...]
[Seungho: What's up? Forget something?]

583
00:26:56,780 --> 00:26:58,380
[Heejin: I was gonna go for a walk.]

584
00:26:58,380 --> 00:27:00,660
[Heejin: Chaebe said he wanted to come, too.]

585
00:27:00,660 --> 00:27:04,520
[Seungho: So you're going together?]
[Heejin: I said I wanted to go solo.]

586
00:27:04,520 --> 00:27:05,980
[Heejin: He insisted on going.]

587
00:27:05,980 --> 00:27:09,590
[Heejin: I told him to go ahead,
and I came back.]

588
00:27:09,590 --> 00:27:13,060
[Jinwoo: Wait, is something wrong?]
[Heejin: Huh? What?]

589
00:27:11,350 --> 00:27:13,290
-What's up? -Is something wrong?

590
00:27:13,060 --> 00:27:16,000
[Jinwoo: Everything alright?]
[Heejin: Nothing.]

591
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:17,070
[Jinwoo: What's with Eunchae?]

592
00:27:17,070 --> 00:27:18,400
[Jinwoo: Why does she seem so down, too?]

593
00:27:18,400 --> 00:27:21,070
[Heejin: What? Eunchae?]
[Jinwoo: Isn't she? Or she's just tired?]

594
00:27:19,370 --> 00:27:20,370
-Isn't she? -Nah.

595
00:27:21,070 --> 00:27:24,010
[Heejin: That's just how she normally looks.]
[Seungho: Yeah, she's usually like that, right?]

596
00:27:22,660 --> 00:27:24,260
-Yeah, she's usually like that. -Always like that.

597
00:27:24,010 --> 00:27:27,210
[Jinwoo: Really? I was walking
on eggshells around her.]
[Heejin: What? Seriously?]

598
00:27:27,740 --> 00:27:30,150
[Eunchae barely ate at first]

599
00:27:30,740 --> 00:27:33,820
[Looking down]

600
00:27:33,820 --> 00:27:35,490
[Jinwoo: Why aren't you eating?]

601
00:27:35,490 --> 00:27:38,420
[Eunchae: Well, today... I ate a lot today already.]

602
00:27:38,860 --> 00:27:42,220
[Worried]

603
00:27:42,690 --> 00:27:45,900
[Why that face, Eunchae?]

604
00:27:46,960 --> 00:27:49,100
[Yongkyu: Ah, what... what was it again?]

605
00:27:49,100 --> 00:27:52,040
[Yongkyu: We grilled meat over charcoal.]

606
00:27:52,040 --> 00:27:53,100
[Eunchae: Grilled meat over charcoal?]

607
00:27:52,480 --> 00:27:53,230
Yeah.

608
00:27:53,100 --> 00:27:55,510
[Yongkyu: Ah, then we put out the fire
and got hit with a face full of smoke.]

609
00:27:55,510 --> 00:27:57,110
[Yongkyu: I inhaled way too much. My head hurts.]

610
00:27:57,110 --> 00:28:00,040
[Eunchae: Ah, you took it right to the face...]
[Yongkyu: You know what I mean, right?]

611
00:28:00,040 --> 00:28:02,710
[Eunchae: It still tasted good, right?]
[Yongkyu: Yeah, really good.]

612
00:28:00,260 --> 00:28:02,320
-It still tasted good, right? -What?

613
00:28:04,050 --> 00:28:06,450
[Eunchae: Charcoal makes all the difference.]
[Yongkyu: Yeah, really good.]

614
00:28:06,780 --> 00:28:09,650
[Yongkyu: Where'd Chaebe go?]

615
00:28:09,650 --> 00:28:13,120
[Eunchae: Oh, yeah, he stepped outside.]

616
00:28:13,660 --> 00:28:16,060
[Yongkyu: Gathering at 11:00, oh.]

617
00:28:16,060 --> 00:28:19,260
[Yongkyu: Seungho, my man.]

618
00:28:19,260 --> 00:28:23,530
[Replying to Chaebe]

619
00:28:24,070 --> 00:28:25,300
[Chaebe: Yeah, I did nothing.
How was your date?]

620
00:28:25,300 --> 00:28:26,500
[Yongkyu: We just ate meat
and went to a boutique, lol.]

621
00:28:26,500 --> 00:28:30,470
[Replying to Chaebe's SBM Talk 2 hours later]

622
00:28:30,470 --> 00:28:33,140
[Sleep instantly]

623
00:28:35,550 --> 00:28:36,350
[Eunchae: Whoa!]

624
00:28:36,350 --> 00:28:38,480
[Yongkyu: Huh? What happened?]

625
00:28:38,480 --> 00:28:40,880
[Eunchae: Did a message come in?]

626
00:28:41,860 --> 00:28:44,420
[Yongkyu: Scared me.]

627
00:28:44,420 --> 00:28:49,700
[Chaebe: Must've been fun!
You must be wiped. Get some rest!]

628
00:28:49,700 --> 00:28:53,740
[Yongkyu: Where are you?]

629
00:28:53,780 --> 00:28:57,580
[Yongkyu: I'm going to sleep.]
[Eunchae: Not gonna reply?]

630
00:28:56,380 --> 00:28:56,770
What?

631
00:28:57,580 --> 00:28:59,840
[Yongkyu: Replied already.]
[Eunchae: Ah, did you?]

632
00:28:59,840 --> 00:29:01,440
[Yongkyu: I'm going to sleep.]

633
00:29:01,440 --> 00:29:02,510
[Yongkyu: Ugh, my head hurts.]

634
00:29:04,700 --> 00:29:06,940
[Yongkyu: My head's killing me.]
[Eunchae: Headache, okay, okay.]

635
00:29:06,940 --> 00:29:10,300
[Yongkyu: Seriously hurting...]
[Eunchae: Headache, okay, okay.]

636
00:29:10,820 --> 00:29:15,380
[Yongkyu knocks out right after talking]

637
00:29:17,380 --> 00:29:18,420
[Yongkyu: Where are you?]

638
00:29:18,420 --> 00:29:22,900
[Yongkyu: Where are you?]
[Chaebe: I'm stuffed,
so I went for a walk on the beach.

639
00:29:23,420 --> 00:29:27,980
[Chaebe comes back without getting Yongkyu's reply]

640
00:29:27,980 --> 00:29:31,900
[Sleeping]

641
00:29:32,940 --> 00:29:35,860
[Quietly]

642
00:29:38,100 --> 00:29:40,460
[Chaebe: Unbelievable.]

643
00:29:40,460 --> 00:29:43,460
[Chaebe: Why'd he even ask]

644
00:29:43,460 --> 00:29:46,420
[Chaebe: if he wanted to sleep.]

645
00:29:47,080 --> 00:29:50,550
[Chaebe looks disappointed]

646
00:29:51,260 --> 00:29:53,220
[Hey guys.]
[Jinwoo: Hey.]
[Heejin: Who is it?]

647
00:29:53,220 --> 00:29:53,740
[It's me.]
[Jinwoo: Hey.]
[Heejin: Who is it?]

648
00:29:53,740 --> 00:29:54,820
[It's me.]
[Jinwoo: Chaebe.]

649
00:29:54,820 --> 00:29:58,290
[Chaebe: Didn't you go, Heejin? To the beach?]
[Heejin: Nope.]

650
00:29:58,290 --> 00:30:00,700
[Heejin: Did you?]
[Chaebe: Yeah.]

651
00:30:00,700 --> 00:30:03,100
[Chaebe: I just sat there.]

652
00:30:03,100 --> 00:30:04,170
[Heejin: Did you walk along the beach?]

653
00:30:04,170 --> 00:30:06,840
[Chaebe: It was pretty chilly.]

654
00:30:06,840 --> 00:30:09,240
[Chaebe: Super cold.]

655
00:30:10,040 --> 00:30:11,910
[Chaebe: Why didn't you go?]

656
00:30:11,910 --> 00:30:14,040
[Heejin: You were gonna go first.]

657
00:30:14,040 --> 00:30:16,710
[Chaebe: Go now.]
[Heejin: Nah, I don't feel like it now.]

658
00:30:16,740 --> 00:30:19,540
[Hahaha] [Hahaha]

659
00:30:19,980 --> 00:30:21,700
[Ridiculous]

660
00:30:21,700 --> 00:30:24,660
[Chaebe: What's up with that?]
[Heejin: What? Just don't feel like it now.]

661
00:30:24,660 --> 00:30:26,530
[Chaebe: Okay then.]
[Heejin: Felt like it earlier though.]

662
00:30:26,530 --> 00:30:31,330
[Chaebe: What's Hyeyeon up to?]
[Heejin: Just ask her.]

663
00:30:31,330 --> 00:30:34,540
[Chaebe: Nah.]

664
00:30:34,540 --> 00:30:37,210
[Jinwoo:But looking at that SBM Talk picture,
it seems like there's something going on.]

665
00:30:37,210 --> 00:30:39,340
[Chaebe: Yeah, it has a very Japanese vibe.]
[Jinwoo: Japanese vibe.]

666
00:30:39,340 --> 00:30:41,210
[Chaebe: Yeah.]
[Jinwoo: Did she dress like that on purpose?]

667
00:30:41,210 --> 00:30:43,080
[Chaebe: Yeah, a kimono?]

668
00:30:43,080 --> 00:30:44,410
[Chaebe: She's wearing a kimono.]
[Jinwoo: Yeah, exactly.]

669
00:30:44,410 --> 00:30:47,350
[Jinwoo: It must be fun.]

670
00:30:49,490 --> 00:30:52,160
[Jinwoo: Does this open? Like a locket?]

671
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:55,360
[Seungho: I haven't tried.]
[Jinwoo: Wanna try?]

672
00:30:55,360 --> 00:30:57,230
[Heejin: Open it up.]

673
00:30:57,230 --> 00:30:59,360
[Chaebe: Let's see.]

674
00:31:00,430 --> 00:31:02,570
[Seungho: Oops.]
[Jinwoo: Ah, my bad.]

675
00:31:02,570 --> 00:31:04,430
[Jinwoo: Guess not, looks like it's built this way.]

676
00:31:04,430 --> 00:31:06,040
[Jinwoo: Because there's a string here.]

677
00:31:06,040 --> 00:31:08,440
[Heejin: Is it real silver?]
[Seungho: No mark on it.]

678
00:31:08,440 --> 00:31:10,040
[Seungho: We stopped by a gift shop]

679
00:31:10,040 --> 00:31:12,180
[Seungho: before going camping.]
[Chaebe: It must be fun.]

680
00:31:14,840 --> 00:31:16,450
[Jinwoo: Sleep if you're tired.]

681
00:31:16,450 --> 00:31:19,380
[Seungho: I'll see.]

682
00:31:20,180 --> 00:31:21,790
[Seungho: What do you mean?]

683
00:31:21,790 --> 00:31:25,520
[Jinwoo: Mind your tone from now on.]

684
00:31:28,730 --> 00:31:30,330
[Seungho: What do you mean?]

685
00:31:30,330 --> 00:31:31,660
[Jinwoo: Nothing.]

686
00:31:31,660 --> 00:31:34,600
[Seungho: What do you mean nothing?
Give me a reason.]

687
00:31:36,470 --> 00:31:39,670
[Jinwoo: Tell you later.]

688
00:31:39,670 --> 00:31:43,410
[Jinwoo: I'm the type who likes
to hash things out right away,]

689
00:31:43,410 --> 00:31:45,540
[Jinwoo: but back then, I couldn't.]

690
00:31:45,540 --> 00:31:48,210
[Jinwoo: We were both totally drained.]

691
00:31:48,210 --> 00:31:52,750
[Jinwoo: I needed time to clear my head, too.]

692
00:31:52,750 --> 00:31:55,420
[Jinwoo: It wasn't the right moment to talk.]

693
00:31:55,420 --> 00:31:56,750
[Jinwoo: My emotions were running high.]

694
00:31:56,750 --> 00:31:59,420
[Jinwoo: I might've said things I'd regret.]

695
00:31:59,420 --> 00:32:03,960
[Jinwoo: So I wanted to cool off
before talking it out.]

696
00:32:04,490 --> 00:32:06,360
[Chaebe: I'm sleepy.]
[Heejin: Sleepy?]

697
00:32:06,360 --> 00:32:08,420
[Chaebe: Should I head to sleep too?]
[Heejin: Sleepy?]

698
00:32:08,420 --> 00:32:09,860
[Chaebe: Should I head to sleep too?]
[Heejin: Yeah.]

699
00:32:09,860 --> 00:32:11,970
[Chaebe: He's already passed out.]

700
00:32:11,970 --> 00:32:13,570
[Chaebe: Over there.]
[Seungho: All asleep?]

701
00:32:13,570 --> 00:32:15,170
[Chaebe: Just Yongkyu.]

702
00:32:13,590 --> 00:32:15,180
Yongkyu's out.

703
00:32:15,170 --> 00:32:16,510
[Seungho: Figured.]

704
00:32:16,510 --> 00:32:17,840
[Jinwoo: Really? Did he look tired?]

705
00:32:17,840 --> 00:32:19,980
[Chaebe: Was he driving today?]

706
00:32:19,980 --> 00:32:20,540
[Seungho: He drove all day today, yeah.]

707
00:32:20,540 --> 00:32:22,420
[Really?] [For real?]
[Seungho: He drove all day today, yeah.]

708
00:32:22,420 --> 00:32:26,380
[Chaebe: Yikes. How come you look
more wiped out though?]

709
00:32:26,380 --> 00:32:29,850
[Chaebe: You good? Get some sleep.]
[Seungho: Yeah, I'm sleeping.]

710
00:32:29,850 --> 00:32:32,790
[Chaebe: I'm out.]
[Seungho: Night.]

711
00:32:32,790 --> 00:32:34,390
[Chaebe: See you at 11:00.]

712
00:32:34,390 --> 00:32:36,790
[Heejin: Bye!]

713
00:32:41,060 --> 00:32:42,930
[Heejin: Can I stay here?]

714
00:32:42,930 --> 00:32:44,270
[Jinwoo: Yeah.]

715
00:32:44,270 --> 00:32:47,200
[Jinwoo: Even if you weren't here,
we wouldn't talk anyway.]

716
00:32:47,200 --> 00:32:49,610
[Jinwoo: I'm not in the mood to talk right now.]

717
00:32:49,610 --> 00:32:52,280
[Heejin: Just talk whenever you're ready.]

718
00:32:52,810 --> 00:32:55,210
[Heejin: Is Eunchae really upset?]

719
00:32:55,210 --> 00:32:57,350
[Heejin: It's kinda bothering me for some reason.]

720
00:32:57,350 --> 00:33:00,860
[Jinwoo: Looks like it to me.]
[Heejin: Really?]

721
00:33:00,860 --> 00:33:03,380
[Jinwoo: But did anyone else make a call?]

722
00:33:03,750 --> 00:33:04,550
[Heejin: Nope.]

723
00:33:04,550 --> 00:33:06,960
[Jinwoo: Nobody?]
[Heejin: Yeah.]

724
00:33:06,960 --> 00:33:08,830
[Heejin: Why?]
[Jinwoo: Nothing, just curious.]

725
00:33:08,830 --> 00:33:12,830
[Heejin: Nope.]
[Jinwoo: Ah, nobody.]

726
00:33:13,100 --> 00:33:16,300
[Jinwoo's thoughts spiral
after finding out Seungho and Hyeyeon texted]

727
00:33:18,180 --> 00:33:19,980
[Sigh...]

728
00:33:19,980 --> 00:33:23,240
[Hyeyeon: If there's another date option next time,]

729
00:33:23,240 --> 00:33:24,570
[Hyeyeon: and you can't pick me,]

730
00:33:24,570 --> 00:33:26,440
[Hyeyeon: the one you dated yesterday...]

731
00:33:26,440 --> 00:33:28,040
[Sujin: I can't pick someone I already dated?]

732
00:33:28,040 --> 00:33:29,380
[Hyeyeon: Anyway, you can't pick me.]

733
00:33:29,380 --> 00:33:31,250
[Hyeyeon: Who would you pick then?]

734
00:33:31,780 --> 00:33:32,580
[Sujin: Me?]

735
00:33:32,580 --> 00:33:34,180
[Sujin: Chaebe or Seungho.]

736
00:33:35,520 --> 00:33:38,990
[Hyeyeon: Personally, kinda curious]

737
00:33:38,990 --> 00:33:40,590
[Hyeyeon: about your chemistry with Seungho.]
[Sujin: Yeah, me too.]

738
00:33:40,590 --> 00:33:42,190
[Hyeyeon: Seungho seems like he'd]

739
00:33:42,190 --> 00:33:45,400
[Hyeyeon: feel awkward around quiet people, too.]

740
00:33:45,400 --> 00:33:47,260
[Hyeyeon: It'd be fun.]

741
00:33:47,260 --> 00:33:48,870
[Sujin: But we're both total clumsy dorks.]

742
00:33:48,870 --> 00:33:50,730
[Hyeyeon: Feels like you'd both just talk nonsense.]

743
00:33:50,730 --> 00:33:51,530
[Hyeyeon: If...]

744
00:33:51,530 --> 00:33:53,670
[Hyeyeon: they tell you]

745
00:33:53,670 --> 00:33:56,610
[Hyeyeon: to go grab something.]

746
00:33:56,610 --> 00:33:57,670
[Hyeyeon: Seungho would probably go,
"Why aren't you moving?"]

747
00:33:58,210 --> 00:33:59,810
[Sujin: "Why don't you go get it?"]

748
00:33:59,810 --> 00:34:01,680
[Hyeyeon: "But you didn't get up, either, Sujin."]

749
00:34:01,680 --> 00:34:02,480
[Sujin: Wanna play Rock, Paper, Scissors?]

750
00:34:02,480 --> 00:34:04,080
[Sujin: Rock, paper, scissors!]

751
00:34:04,080 --> 00:34:05,150
[Hyeyeon: Seungho would definitely win, and then...]

752
00:34:08,350 --> 00:34:11,020
[Sujin: New mission!]
[Hyeyeon: A new mission arrived.]

753
00:34:11,020 --> 00:34:15,940
[MISSION] [STAND BI ME]

754
00:34:15,940 --> 00:34:17,460
[Tense]

755
00:34:18,489 --> 00:34:21,699
[Is there someone you want
to express your feelings to? Text their name.]

756
00:34:22,460 --> 00:34:25,500
[Did you see it?] [What?]

757
00:34:25,500 --> 00:34:26,260
[Did you see it?] [Yeah?]

758
00:34:26,770 --> 00:34:28,909
[Yongkyu: What?]
[Eunchae: Mission.]

759
00:34:28,909 --> 00:34:32,940
[Yongkyu: Got a mission?]

760
00:34:32,940 --> 00:34:34,139
[Eunchae: Just now, just now.]

761
00:34:35,850 --> 00:34:39,580
[Heejin: Wake up, mission's here.]
[Jinwoo: Yours?]

762
00:34:39,580 --> 00:34:40,380
[Jinwoo: Mine.]

763
00:34:42,250 --> 00:34:44,120
[Pressure, pressure.]
[Jinwoo: But it's not that kind of mission.]

764
00:34:44,120 --> 00:34:45,719
[Jinwoo: It's that]

765
00:34:45,719 --> 00:34:48,389
[Jinwoo: vote by sending a name thing.]

766
00:34:48,659 --> 00:34:52,400
[Is there someone you want
to express your feelings to? Text their name.]

767
00:34:52,929 --> 00:34:55,330
[Heejin: That question]

768
00:34:55,330 --> 00:34:58,530
[Heejin: feels kinda deep.]

769
00:34:58,530 --> 00:34:59,600
[Heejin: It was a bit overwhelming.]

770
00:34:59,600 --> 00:35:04,140
[Heejin: That question felt like a lot.
Do I even have feelings for anyone?]

771
00:35:04,140 --> 00:35:07,610
[Heejin: I don't think I'm there yet.]

772
00:35:07,610 --> 00:35:10,280
[Heejin: I'm really torn.]

773
00:35:10,280 --> 00:35:13,750
[Jinwoo sends his answer right away,
while Seungho hesitates]

774
00:35:13,750 --> 00:35:16,690
[Jinwoo: Guess it's still me, right? So far.]

775
00:35:17,340 --> 00:35:20,180
[Stealing a glance]

776
00:35:20,580 --> 00:35:23,090
[Do you have someone you want to convey
your feelings to? Please send their name.]

777
00:35:23,090 --> 00:35:24,160
[Sujin: I probably don't...]

778
00:35:24,160 --> 00:35:26,030
[Sujin: No, maybe not, maybe not.]

779
00:35:26,030 --> 00:35:27,900
[Sujin: Not sure if I do or not.]
[Hyeyeon: Answer honestly. Honestly.]

780
00:35:27,900 --> 00:35:28,700
[Hyeyeon: We really have to answer honestly.]

781
00:35:28,700 --> 00:35:29,770
[Sujin: I'm not sure if I do or not.]

782
00:35:29,770 --> 00:35:31,630
[Hyeyeon: We really have to answer honestly.]

783
00:35:31,630 --> 00:35:35,100
[Hyeyeon: Send it to your first pick.]

784
00:35:35,100 --> 00:35:36,440
[Hyeyeon: Do what you want.]
[Sujin: That's so sudden.]

785
00:35:36,440 --> 00:35:38,310
[Sujin: You suddenly abandoned me...]

786
00:35:38,310 --> 00:35:39,640
[Sujin: "Do what you want."]

787
00:35:39,640 --> 00:35:40,980
[Sujin: Are you angry at me?]

788
00:35:40,980 --> 00:35:43,380
[Sujin: "Do what you want."]
[Hyeyeon: I have mixed feelings right now.]

789
00:35:43,380 --> 00:35:46,320
[Sujin: She even said "do what you want."]

790
00:35:46,320 --> 00:35:48,340
[Hyeyeon: That's ridiculous.]

791
00:35:49,540 --> 00:35:54,380
[Who will Sujin and Hyeyeon send their hearts to?]

792
00:35:55,120 --> 00:36:00,580
[Chaebe and Yongkyu, conveying their feelings]

793
00:36:02,620 --> 00:36:05,260
[Hah~]

794
00:36:05,270 --> 00:36:06,340
[Eunchae: Did you send it?]

795
00:36:06,340 --> 00:36:08,470
[Chaebe: Yeah. Why the sigh?]
[Eunchae: Ah, you sent it?]

796
00:36:08,470 --> 00:36:10,340
[Chaebe: Yeah. I sent it too.]

797
00:36:12,100 --> 00:36:15,060
[Eunchae, who hasn't sent hers yet]

798
00:36:15,140 --> 00:36:18,080
[Eunchae: Oh, I don't know anymore.]

799
00:36:19,150 --> 00:36:23,950
[Eunchae: I have feelings for two people
right now.]

800
00:36:23,950 --> 00:36:25,290
[Eunchae: Heejin and Hyeyeon.]

801
00:36:25,290 --> 00:36:29,290
[After a long time, she finally sends a name]

802
00:36:29,290 --> 00:36:31,430
[Eunchae: Oh, seriously.]

803
00:36:31,690 --> 00:36:36,500
[Who did Eunchae send her heart to?]

804
00:36:37,030 --> 00:36:39,440
[Meanwhile, Heejin is still agonizing]

805
00:36:39,700 --> 00:36:43,170
[Heejin: Since it's Thursday, gradually]

806
00:36:43,170 --> 00:36:45,310
[Heejin: it's inevitable that things
get deeper, right?]

807
00:36:45,840 --> 00:36:48,240
[Jinwoo: Probably?]

808
00:36:48,240 --> 00:36:50,380
[Heejin: Am I too slow?]

809
00:36:50,380 --> 00:36:53,580
[Heejin: Is there anything between Eunchae
and Sujin?]

810
00:36:54,650 --> 00:36:56,940
[Heejin: Just asking if you know anything.]

811
00:36:56,940 --> 00:36:58,220
[Heejin: There's something going on
between them, right?]

812
00:36:58,220 --> 00:36:58,680
[Really?]

813
00:36:58,680 --> 00:36:59,140
[Heejin: There's something going on
between them, right?]

814
00:36:59,140 --> 00:37:01,590
[Heejin: I feel like there is.]

815
00:37:01,590 --> 00:37:03,190
[Jinwoo: But I'm not sure.]

816
00:37:03,190 --> 00:37:05,380
[Seungho: I don't think so.]

817
00:37:05,380 --> 00:37:06,400
[Really?]
[Seungho: I don't think so.]

818
00:37:06,420 --> 00:37:10,150
[I think there is. Why? What's up?]
[Jinwoo: Because while you were gone, Eunchae]

819
00:37:10,150 --> 00:37:11,220
[Jinwoo: said something like this.]

820
00:37:11,220 --> 00:37:14,160
[Seungho: I still need to sleep though.]

821
00:37:14,160 --> 00:37:17,630
[Jinwoo: She said she wanted to send SBM Talk
to two people today.]

822
00:37:19,620 --> 00:37:21,100
[Jinwoo: So I kept asking]

823
00:37:21,100 --> 00:37:24,030
[Jinwoo: "Who?" But she never told me in the end.]

824
00:37:24,030 --> 00:37:27,500
[Jinwoo: Since it's two people, it feels
even more confusing.]

825
00:37:27,500 --> 00:37:30,710
[Heejin: I sent my vote to Eunchae yesterday.]

826
00:37:30,710 --> 00:37:33,110
[Jinwoo: Really?]
[Heejin: Yeah. What's wrong?]

827
00:37:33,110 --> 00:37:35,240
[Jinwoo: I didn't know.]
[Heejin: You didn't know?]

828
00:37:35,240 --> 00:37:38,980
[Heejin: So I think one of them is me,
and the other is probably Sujin.]

829
00:37:38,980 --> 00:37:41,920
[Heejin: Because Sujin sent me an SBM Talk before]

830
00:37:41,920 --> 00:37:44,320
[Heejin: so there's a record.]

831
00:37:44,320 --> 00:37:47,700
[Heejin: But other than that, Sujin is
at 0 right now.]

832
00:37:47,700 --> 00:37:48,280
[Really?]

833
00:37:48,280 --> 00:37:48,860
[Heejin: But other than that, Sujin is
at 0 right now.]

834
00:37:48,860 --> 00:37:52,600
[Heejin: Other than me, the person Sujin would
send an SBM Talk to.]

835
00:37:52,600 --> 00:37:54,460
[Jinwoo: I think it's Eunchae.]
[Heejin: Probably Eunchae, right?]

836
00:37:54,460 --> 00:37:56,330
[Heejin: Honestly, I think it's only Eunchae.]

837
00:37:56,330 --> 00:37:58,780
[Jinwoo: She said she'd send one today.]
[Seungho: So Eunchae is also at 0 right now?]

838
00:37:58,780 --> 00:37:59,980
[Heejin: Eunchae and I have never sent
each other SBM Talk.]

839
00:37:59,980 --> 00:38:00,540
[Oh, I can't see it]

840
00:38:00,540 --> 00:38:01,100
[Heejin: Eunchae and I have never sent
each other SBM Talk.]

841
00:38:01,100 --> 00:38:01,840
[Oh, I can't see it]
[Jinwoo: You've never sent each other SBM Talk?]

842
00:38:01,840 --> 00:38:02,580
[Heejin: Eunchae to me...]

843
00:38:02,580 --> 00:38:03,810
[Seungho: Oh, right.]
[Jinwoo: Should I try?]

844
00:38:03,810 --> 00:38:05,140
[Seungho: Send one now.]
[Jinwoo: Should I try?]

845
00:38:06,740 --> 00:38:08,260
[Heejin: You're very straightforward.]

846
00:38:08,260 --> 00:38:10,130
[Jinwoo: What should I ask her?]

847
00:38:10,130 --> 00:38:12,270
[Jinwoo: If I ask directly, she might
feel bad, right?]

848
00:38:12,270 --> 00:38:13,870
[Jinwoo: I feel like she'd get upset.]

849
00:38:13,870 --> 00:38:14,940
[Heejin: Eunchae, did something happen?]

850
00:38:14,940 --> 00:38:16,540
[Heejin: Is it not the right time?
Is it a bit off?]

851
00:38:16,540 --> 00:38:18,140
[Jinwoo: Saying that sounds like
expressing interest.]

852
00:38:18,140 --> 00:38:20,810
[Jinwoo: "Eunchae-chan, did something happen?"
Should I send it like that?]

853
00:38:20,810 --> 00:38:24,810
[Heejin: "Eunchae, if you're bored, come to
our room." Like that.]

854
00:38:22,760 --> 00:38:24,290
"Come hang out." Like that.

855
00:38:24,810 --> 00:38:25,620
[Heejin: Is that not appropriate?]

856
00:38:26,680 --> 00:38:27,910
[Everything feels inappropriate]
[Jinwoo: No...]

857
00:38:27,910 --> 00:38:29,140
[Heejin: Everything feels inappropriate?]

858
00:38:29,140 --> 00:38:30,200
[Jinwoo: Everything feels inappropriate.]

859
00:38:31,270 --> 00:38:34,740
[Jinwoo: I didn't send that message with
that intention. It feels a bit off.]

860
00:38:34,740 --> 00:38:37,140
[Seungho: I don't like you.]

861
00:38:37,140 --> 00:38:38,480
[Seungho: But...]

862
00:38:38,480 --> 00:38:39,810
[Jinwoo: So long-winded. Wow...]

863
00:38:39,810 --> 00:38:41,950
[Jinwoo: That would instantly kill the mood.]

864
00:38:41,950 --> 00:38:44,620
[Jinwoo: "Eunchae, it's not that I like you."]

865
00:38:44,620 --> 00:38:45,690
[Jinwoo: "Don't misunderstand. Just listen
to me."]

866
00:38:49,960 --> 00:38:52,090
[Jinwoo: "Eunchae, if you're bored, do you want
to come to our room?"]

867
00:38:52,090 --> 00:38:54,760
[Jinwoo: In parentheses.]

868
00:38:54,760 --> 00:38:56,360
[Jinwoo: "Really, really not because I like you.
Just listen. Don't misunderstand."]

869
00:39:01,970 --> 00:39:03,570
[Jinwoo: Should I ask if she sent it?
The SBM Talk?]

870
00:39:03,570 --> 00:39:06,240
[Heejin: Yeah, sure.]

871
00:39:07,840 --> 00:39:09,710
[Jinwoo: "Eunchae-chan, did you send
your SBM Talk??"]

872
00:39:09,710 --> 00:39:12,650
[Heejin: I really don't know who to vote
for anymore.]

873
00:39:12,650 --> 00:39:14,980
[Huh? Eunchae still has 3 chances left]

874
00:39:14,980 --> 00:39:16,540
[See? She sent one]

875
00:39:15,020 --> 00:39:15,830
See?

876
00:39:17,180 --> 00:39:19,850
[Heejin: Oh, hold on.]

877
00:39:19,850 --> 00:39:21,450
[Jinwoo: So you think your guess is right?]

878
00:39:21,450 --> 00:39:23,320
[Seungho: Yeah.]
[Heejin: Yeah, I think so.]

879
00:39:23,320 --> 00:39:25,730
[Heejin: I'm pretty good at figuring
things out, aren't I?]

880
00:39:25,730 --> 00:39:27,060
[Jinwoo: Then the reason she's in a bad mood]

881
00:39:27,060 --> 00:39:29,200
[Jinwoo: is because Sujin and Hyeyeon
aren't back yet.]

882
00:39:29,200 --> 00:39:31,540
[Seungho: Yeah, probably.]

883
00:39:31,540 --> 00:39:35,740
[Shocked]

884
00:39:35,740 --> 00:39:38,660
[Oh...]

885
00:39:39,070 --> 00:39:42,810
[Heejin: I'll cheer for her.]

886
00:39:45,480 --> 00:39:48,950
[Jinwoo: "Eunchae-chan, did you send
your SBM Talk??"]

887
00:39:55,350 --> 00:39:59,090
[Chaebe: What did you get?]
[Eunchae: SBM Talk.]

888
00:39:59,090 --> 00:40:02,030
[Chaebe: Did you send an SBM Talk?]
[Eunchae: I haven't sent mine yet.]

889
00:40:02,030 --> 00:40:03,360
[Chaebe: Then how did you get one?]

890
00:40:03,360 --> 00:40:05,770
[Chaebe: Who sent it?]

891
00:40:05,770 --> 00:40:07,900
[Chaebe: How did you get one if you didn't
send one?]

892
00:40:07,900 --> 00:40:11,100
[Eunchae: Of course I can receive them.]
[Chaebe: Nice.]

